    <!-- ===== FAQ SECTION ===== -->
    <section class="faq-section">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
            <span class="section-tag">Quick Answers</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked <em>Questions</em></h2>
            <div class="divider-ornament"><i class="fas fa-diamond"></i></div>
            <p class="section-desc">Can't find what you're looking for? Browse our most common questions or contact us
                directly.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-list reveal">

            <div class="faq-item open">
                <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                    <span class="faq-q-text">How long does delivery take and which cities do you deliver to?</span>
                    <div class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></div>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                        We deliver to 25+ cities across India, including Delhi NCR, Mumbai, Bangalore, Chennai,
                        Hyderabad, Pune, Kolkata, and more. Standard delivery takes 7–14 working days. Free delivery is
                        available on all orders above ₹10,000. For metro cities, we often deliver within 5–7 working
                        days. Assembly is included free with all bedroom and dining sets.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                    <span class="faq-q-text">Can I customise furniture in terms of size, colour or fabric?</span>
                    <div class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></div>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                        Absolutely! We offer full customisation on most of our products. You can choose from a wide
                        range of fabrics, leathers, wood finishes, and colours. Custom dimensions are also available.
                        Please contact our design team via phone, WhatsApp or the form above — customisation orders
                        typically take 3–5 additional weeks.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                    <span class="faq-q-text">What is your return and exchange policy?</span>
                    <div class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></div>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                        We offer a 30-day hassle-free return and exchange policy on all standard products. If you are
                        not satisfied with your purchase for any reason, simply contact our support team within 30 days
                        of delivery and we will arrange a pickup and full refund. Please note that customised orders are
                        non-refundable unless there is a manufacturing defect.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                    <span class="faq-q-text">How does the 5-year warranty work?</span>
                    <div class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></div>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                        All LuxeCasa products come with a comprehensive 5-year warranty covering structural and
                        craftsmanship defects. If any defect is found within the warranty period, we will repair or
                        replace the piece at no cost to you. The warranty does not cover normal wear and tear,
                        accidental damage or improper use. To raise a warranty claim, simply email us at
                        support@luxecasa.com with your order number and photos.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                    <span class="faq-q-text">Do you offer bulk or corporate orders for offices, hotels or
                        restaurants?</span>
                    <div class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></div>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                        Yes, we cater to bulk and corporate orders and offer special pricing for large quantities.
                        Whether you are furnishing an office, hotel, restaurant, or residential project, our B2B team is
                        ready to assist with custom solutions, exclusive discounts and dedicated project management.
                        Please reach out to us at info@luxecasa.com or call +91 98765 43210 to discuss your
                        requirements.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                    <span class="faq-q-text">Can I book a free interior design consultation?</span>
                    <div class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></div>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                        Yes! We offer free 60-minute interior design consultations at all three of our showrooms. Our
                        design experts will help you select the right furniture, understand space planning and match
                        colours and styles to your home. You can book a consultation by calling us, messaging us on
                        WhatsApp, or submitting the contact form above — select "Interior Design Consultation" as your
                        subject.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="faq-cta-row reveal">
